  "contracts": {
    "final_boss_phase": "The current shared damage/death owner admits the lethal actor path, writes state1/death clock and stops movement. Its boss optional lane supplies a definition; byte+0x64 exactly1 and LOW BYTE Game+0xba8 zero admit phase1/death clock+0xbac. Shared phase is separate from normal run termination.",
    "snapshot": "Non-client snapshot145c27010 tail-calls145ccc4e0 with inner Game (wrapper+0x10). Game+0xba8 is copied as a low byte to snapshot+c1; snapshot+c0 separately reflects terminal state. Mode2 snapshots use the accepted State15 cache subject to d70<=1/cache present.",
    "clear_admission": "145c27820 requires snapshot+c1 exactly1, account GUID !=0xffffff and mode2 or host flags bit0 clear. Normal class-zone insertion, Heroic advancement and Save dirty handling are independent of later notices/summary.",
    "delivery": "The driver gates whole shared phase nonzero/host flags0; the clear helper separately requires low-byte phase exactly1. Periodic poll observes that copied phase. Accepted State15 installs its cache and calls clear145c27820 following private update work without a terminal edge or choice-drain gate.",
    "rank_and_persistence": "Effective rank min(snapshot rank, current Save class-zone unlock ceiling) is captured BEFORE Normal insertion. Normal pair mutation precedes monotone Heroic write using that captured minimum; save only on changed Normal/Heroic state. Existing allocation/sort/save interfaces remain bounded dependencies."
  },
